0 HEAD
1 SOUR gedcom-go
2 VERS 1.0.0
2 NAME gedcom-go test suite
1 GEDC
2 VERS 5.5.1
2 FORM LINEAGE-LINKED
1 CHAR UTF-8
1 NOTE Blank line test file.
2 CONT Original work for issue #301. Blank and whitespace-only lines are
2 CONT invalid per the GEDCOM spec; strict mode must error, lenient mode
2 CONT must skip them with EMPTY_LINE diagnostics.
0 @I1@ INDI
1 NAME Before /Blank/

1 SEX M
   
0 @I2@ INDI
1 NAME After /Blank/
	
0 TRLR
